      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8470387::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The W-induced intermetallic compounds and lattice distortion enhance load-bearing capacity.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "W-induced structural changes promote controlled development of an oxide layer during sliding.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "W alloying increases the hardness of AlCoCrFeNi.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Frictional contact on the W-alloyed material produces a stable, lubricious oxide layer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The combination of increased load capacity and a lubricious oxide layer reduces friction fluctuations and wear loss at elevated temperatures.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The untreated alloy has higher friction and wear because it has lower inherent hardness and forms a less effective oxide layer.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The beneficial effect is restricted to an optimal W level of approximately 0.5 at.%.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Excess W could produce undesirable phases or mechanical brittleness.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
